# Skill eval run artifacts — transcripts, gradings, timings, benchmarks, viewer logs, canary audits.
# Regenerated on every eval run and machine-specific, so they are not source of truth.
# The eval *definitions* (evals/<name>/evals.json, fixtures/, coverage.md) ARE committed — only runs are ignored.
evals/*/runs/
evals/_dashboard/

